       Identification Division.                                         00010000
       Program-ID. F115ICA0.                                            00020000
       Author.  Henning Langfeldt Rødland.                              00030000
      *################################################################*00040000
      *                                                                 00050000
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00060000
      *                                                                 00070000
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Contract_Amount.  00080003
      *                                                                 00090003
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00100003
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00110003
      * from- and to- values.                                           00120003
      *                                                                 00130003
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00140003
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00150003
      *                                                                 00160003
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00170003
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00180003
      *      See seperate description below.                            00190003
      *                                                                 00200003
      *                                                                 00210003
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00220003
      *                                                                 00230003
      *    Initialize                          R115ICA0-Contract-Amount 00240003
      *    Set   R115ICA0-Version        To    True                     00250003
      *    Set   R115ICA0-In-Select      To    True                     00260003
      *                                                                 00270025
      * One of these:                                                   00280025
      * 1) Set   R115ICA0-In-Actual      To    True                     00290025
      * 2) Set   R115ICA0-In-Work        To    True                     00300025
      *                                                                 00310025
      *    Move  &fin-inst-id            To    R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  00320003
      *    Move  &contract-type          To    R115ICA0-In-Contract-Type00330003
      *    Move  &contract-no            To    R115ICA0-In-Contract-No  00340003
      *    Move  &currency (ISO 4217)    To    R115ICA0-In-Currency     00350003
      *                                                                 00360003
      *    Call  'F115ICA0'              Using R115ICA0-Contract-Amount 00370003
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00380005
      *    End-Call                                                     00390003
      *                                                                 00400003
      *    Evaluate True                                                00410003
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00420005
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00430005
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00440003
      *                                                                 00450003
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00460005
      *        ...not found...                                          00470003
      *                                                                 00480003
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00490005
      *        ...found...                                              00500003
      *                                                                 00510003
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00520003
      *                                                                 00530003
      *################################################################*00540000
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00550000
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00560000
      *190600!HLR! Removed cursors CT, CN, CU, FI-CN, FI-CU,     !LO18! 00570031
      *      !   ! CT-CN, CT-CU, CN-CU, FI-CT-CU, FI-CN-CU,      !    ! 00580031
      *      !   ! CT-CN-CU.                                     !    ! 00590031
      *      !   ! Changed cursor-qual. on FK_TFMC_Contr_Type    !    ! 00600031
      *      !   ! from "Like" to "=".                           !    ! 00610031
      *      !   ! Removed interval on Contract-No.              !    ! 00620032
      *290199!HLR! New module                                    !LG10! 00630000
