               10  WC-Row-No             Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01120000
               10  WC-Total-No-Of-Rows   Pic S9(11)              Comp-3.01130000
      *                                                                 01140000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01150000
      * Switches used for selecting the correct cursor:                 01160000
      *                                                                 01170000
           05  SW-Cursor-Code.                                          01180000
               10  SW-CC-Fin-Inst        Pic  X(01).                    01190000
                 88  SW-Use-Fin-Inst                Value 'F'.          01200000
               10  SW-CC-Contract-Type   Pic  X(01).                    01210000
                 88  SW-Use-Contract-Type           Value 'T'.          01220000
               10  SW-CC-Contract-No     Pic  X(01).                    01230000
                 88  SW-Use-Contract-No             Value 'N'.          01240000
               10  SW-CC-Currency        Pic  X(01).                    01250000
                 88  SW-Use-Currency                Value 'C'.          01260000
      *                                                                 01270000
           05  Filler                    Redefines SW-Cursor-Code       01280000
                                         Pic  X(04).                    01290000
             88  SW-Use-Fi-Asc                      Value 'F   '.       01300000
             88  SW-Use-Fi-CT-Asc                   Value 'FT  '.       01310000
             88  SW-Use-Fi-CT-CN-Asc                Value 'FTN '.       01320000
             88  SW-Use-Fi-CT-CN-Cu-Asc             Value 'FTNC'.       01330000
      *                                                                 01340000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01350000
      * These fields are used for SQL qualification:                    01360000
