      * These fields are used for comparison with the WS-fields.        01450000
      *                                                                 01460000
           05  WE-Cursor-Info.                                          01470000
             07  WE-Key.                                                01480000
               10  WE-Fin-Inst-ID        Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01490000
               10  WE-Fin-Inst-No        Pic  X(18).                    01500008
               10  WE-Contract-Type      Pic  X(03).                    01510000
               10  WE-Contract-No        Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01520032
               10  WE-Currency           Pic  X(03).                    01530000
             07  WE-Code-Sequence        Pic  X(01).                    01540000
               88  WE-CS-Ascending                  Value 'A'.          01550000
               88  WE-CS-Descending                 Value 'D'.          01560000
      *                                                                 01570000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01580000
      * Storage, and switches for identifying the content:              01590000
      * The cursor info is used to verify that the get-next has the     01600000
      * same qualification as the get-1st.                              01610000
      *                                                                 01620000
       01  W-Storage.                                                   01630000
      *                                                                 01640000
           05  WS-Cursor-Info.                                          01650000
             07  WS-Key.                                                01660000
               10  WS-Fin-Inst-ID        Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01670000
               10  WS-Fin-Inst-No        Pic  X(18).                    01680008
               10  WS-Contract-Type      Pic  X(03).                    01690000
               10  WS-Contract-No        Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01700032
               10  WS-Currency           Pic  X(03).                    01710000
             07  WS-Code-Sequence        Pic  X(01).                    01720000
               88  WS-CS-Ascending                  Value 'A'.          01730000
               88  WS-CS-Descending                 Value 'D'.          01740000
             07  WS-Cursor-Status        Pic  X(08).                    01750000
               88  WS-Cursor-OK                     Value 'OK'.         01760000
               88  WS-Cursor-End                    Value 'END'.        01770000
      *                                                                 01780000
      * We store all occurences that are read, also those that we do    01790000
      * not find. This is to reduce the number of DB2 accesses.         01800000
      *                                                                 01810000
           05  WS-DB2-Table.                                            01820000
             07  WS-DB2-Row              Occurs 10 Times.               01830000
               10  WS-DB2-Tbl-Version    Pic  X(16).                    01840026
               10  WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID    Pic S9(18)              Comp-3.01850026
               10  WS-DB2-Contract-Type  Pic  X(03).                    01860000
               10  WS-DB2-Contract-No    Pic S9(07)              Comp-3.01870000
               10  WS-DB2-Currency       Pic  X(03).                    01880000
               10  WS-DB2-Row-Status     Pic S9(01)              Comp-3.01890016
                 88  WS-DB2-Not-Read                Value +0.           01900000
                 88  WS-DB2-Read                    Value +1.           01910000
                 88  WS-DB2-Not-Found               Value +2.           01920000
               10  WS-DB2-DCL            Pic  X(250).                   01930000
      *                                                                 01940000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01950000
      * Areas for use when accessing DB2.                               01960000
