           .                                                            03590000
      *################################################################.03600000
       D000-Get-1st                      Section.                       03610000
      *                                                                 03620000
           Perform D100-Prepare-Input                                   03630000
           Perform D200-Prepare-Qualification                           03640000
           Perform D300-Select-Cursor                                   03650000
           If  R115ICA0-In-CC-Count                                     03660000
               Perform D400-Count-Cursor                                03670000
           End-If                                                       03680000
           Perform D500-Open-Cursor                                     03690000
      *                                                                 03700000
