      *################################################################.03720000
       D100-Prepare-Input                Section.                       03730000
      *                                                                 03740000
      * We create internal from- and to-values, depending on the input. 03750000
      *                                                                 03760000
           Initialize                          WE-Cursor-Info           03770000
      *                                                                 03780000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-ID To    WE-Fin-Inst-ID           03790000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-No To    WE-Fin-Inst-No           03800000
      *                                                                 03810000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Contract-Type                              03820000
                                         To    WE-Contract-Type         03830000
      *    Move  +0                      To    W-Tally                  03840031
      *    Inspect WE-Contract-Type     Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'03850031
      *    If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       03860031
      *        Inspect WE-Contract-Type  Converting '* ' to '%%'        03870031
      *    End-If                                                       03880031
      *                                                                 03890000
      *                                                                 03901333
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Contract-No To    WE-Contract-No           03902033
      *                                                                 03910000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Currency    To    WE-Currency              03920000
           Move  +0                      To    W-Tally                  03930022
           Inspect WE-Currency          Tallying W-Tally for all '*' '%'03940022
           If  W-Tally                   >     +0                       03950022
               Inspect WE-Currency       Converting '* ' to '%%'        03960022
           End-If                                                       03970021
      *                                                                 03980000
           .                                                            03990000
      *################################################################.04000000
       D200-Prepare-Qualification        Section.                       04010000
      *                                                                 04020000
      * We store the qualification, so that we can check that the       04030000
      * qualification do not change on any following Get-Next.          04040000
      *                                                                 04050000
           Initialize                          WS-Cursor-Info           04060000
           Move  WE-Key                  To    WS-Key                   04070000
           Move  WE-Code-Sequence        To    WS-Code-Sequence         04080000
      *                                                                 04090000
           Initialize WC-Counters                                       04100000
      *                                                                 04110000
      * We fill in the SQL host variables.                              04120000
      *                                                                 04130000
           Initialize                          W-DB-Key                 04140000
      *                                                                 04150000
           Move  WE-Fin-Inst-ID          To    W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID         04160000
           Move  WE-Contract-Type        To    W-DB-Contract-Type       04170000
           Move  WE-Contract-No          To    W-DB-Contract-No         04180032
           Move  WE-Currency             To    W-DB-Currency            04190000
      *                                                                 04200000
           If  WE-Fin-Inst-No            Not = Space                    04210008
           and W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID          =     +0                       04220000
               Move  WE-Fin-Inst-No      To    W-Fin-Inst-No            04230000
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           04240000
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID         04250000
           End-If                                                       04260000
      *                                                                 04270000
           .                                                            04280000
      *################################################################.04290000
       D300-Select-Cursor                Section.                       04300000
      *                                                                 04310000
      * We choose which cursor to use, depending on the qualification.  04320000
      *                                                                 04330000
           Move  Space                   To    SW-Cursor-Code           04340000
      *                                                                 04350000
           If  W-DB-Fin-Inst-ID          Not = +0                       04360000
               Set  Sw-Use-Fin-Inst      To    True                     04370000
           End-If                                                       04380000
      *                                                                 04390000
           If  W-DB-Contract-Type        Not = Space                    04400020
      *    and W-DB-Contract-Type (1:1)  Not = '%'                      04410031
               Set   SW-Use-Contract-Type                               04420000
                                         To    True                     04430000
           End-If                                                       04440019
      *                                                                 04450000
           If  W-DB-Contract-No          Not = +0                       04460032
               Set   SW-Use-Contract-No  To    True                     04470000
           End-If                                                       04480032
      *                                                                 04490000
           If  W-DB-Currency             Not = Space                    04500020
           and W-DB-Currency (1:1)       Not = '%'                      04510020
               Set  Sw-Use-Currency      To    True                     04520000
           End-If                                                       04530000
      *                                                                 04540000
           Evaluate True                                                04550000
             When SW-Use-Fi-Asc                                         04560000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-Asc                                      04570000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-CN-Asc                                   04580000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-CN-Cu-Asc                                04590000
               Continue                                                 04600000
      *                                                                 04610000
             When other                                                 04620000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    04630005
               Move  'GL-CURSOR-UV'      To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  04640005
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)04650005
               Move  SW-Cursor-Code      To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)04660005
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               04670000
               Move  'D302'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       04680005
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       04690000
      *                                                                 04700000
           End-Evaluate                                                 04710000
      *                                                                 04720000
           .                                                            04730000
      *################################################################.04740000
       D400-Count-Cursor                 Section.                       04750000
