           Initialize                          R115ICAS-SQL-Submodules  04770000
           Set   R115ICAS-Version        To    True                     04780000
           Set   R115ICAS-In-Count-Cursor                               04790000
                                         To    True                     04800000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Table-Version                              04810026
                                         To    R115ICAS-In-Table-Version04820026
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115ICAS-Cursor-Code     04830026
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115ICAS-DB-Key          04840000
      *                                                                 04850000
           Call  'F115ICAR'              Using R115ICAS-SQL-Submodules  04860000
                                               DCLTF-Contract-Amount    04870000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      04880005
           End-Call                                                     04890000
      *                                                                 04900000
