             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    04920005
               Move  R115ICAS-Out-Total-Rows                            04930000
                                         To    WC-Total-No-Of-Rows      04940000
      *                                                                 04950000
             When other                                                 04960000
               Move  'D401'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       04970005
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       04980000
      *                                                                 04990000
           End-Evaluate                                                 05000000
