      *################################################################.05430000
       E100-Check-Qualification          Section.                       05440000
      *                                                                 05450000
      * We use the WE-fields for comparison with the WS-fields.         05460000
      * This to verify that the qualification has not changes since     05470000
      * the Get-1st.                                                    05480000
      *                                                                 05490000
           Evaluate True                                                05500000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   05510000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         05520000
             and  WS-Cursor-OK                                          05530000
               Continue                                                 05540000
      *                                                                 05550000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   05560000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         05570000
             and  WS-Cursor-End                                         05580000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    05590005
               Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE'     To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05600005
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)05610005
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)05620005
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               05630000
               Move  'E101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05640005
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05650000
      *                                                                 05660000
             When Other                                                 05670000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    05680005
               Move  'GL-BRUK-GET-1ST'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  05690005
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               05700000
               Move  'E102'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05710005
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05720000
      *                                                                 05730000
           End-Evaluate                                                 05740000
      *                                                                 05750000
           .                                                            05760000
      *################################################################.05770000
       E200-Fetch-Cursor                 Section.                       05780000
