           Initialize                          R115ICAS-SQL-Submodules  05800000
           Set   R115ICAS-Version        To    True                     05810000
           Set   R115ICAS-In-Fetch-Cursor                               05820000
                                         To    True                     05830000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Table-Version                              05840026
                                         To    R115ICAS-In-Table-Version05850026
           Move  Sw-Cursor-Code          To    R115ICAS-Cursor-Code     05860000
           Move  W-DB-Key                To    R115ICAS-DB-Key          05870000
      *                                                                 05880000
           Call  'F115ICAR'              Using R115ICAS-SQL-Submodules  05890000
                                               DCLTF-Contract-Amount    05900000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      05910005
           End-Call                                                     05920000
      *                                                                 05930000
           Evaluate True                                                05940000
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    05950005
               Add   +1                  To    WC-Row-No                05960000
      *                                                                 05970000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 05980005
               Set   WS-Cursor-End       To    True                     05990000
               If  WC-Row-No             =     +0                       06000000
                 Then                                                   06010000
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    06020005
                   Move  'DB-FOREKOMST-NF'                              06030000
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06040005
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06050005
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06060005
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           06070000
                 Else                                                   06080000
                   Initialize                  R7918030-ErrorMessage    06090005
                   Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06100005
                   Move  'VAR1'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06110005
                   Move  W-Table-Name    To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06120005
                   Perform Z000-Error-Message                           06130000
               End-If                                                   06140000
      *                                                                 06150000
             When other                                                 06160000
               Move  'E201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06170005
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06180000
      *                                                                 06190000
           End-Evaluate                                                 06200000
      *                                                                 06210000
           .                                                            06220000
      *################################################################.06230000
       F000-Select                       Section.                       06240000
      *                                                                 06250000
           Perform F100-Prepare-Qualification                           06260000
      *                                                                 06270000
      * We will first look through the storage, to see if we have       06280000
      * already got the wanted occurence.                               06290000
      *                                                                 06300000
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        06310000
      *                                                                 06320000
      * If we didn't find anything, we need to read. Then we store.     06330000
      *                                                                 06340000
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         06350000
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 06360000
               Perform F200-Select-Row                                  06370000
               Perform L100-Store-DCL                                   06380000
           End-If                                                       06390000
      *                                                                 06400000
      * At last we check what we've got to offer.                       06410000
      *                                                                 06420000
           Evaluate True                                                06430000
             When WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS)                                  06440000
               Move  WS-DB2-DCL (Ind-WS) To    DCLTF-Contract-Amount    06450000
               Perform J000-Get-Columns                                 06460000
      *                                                                 06470000
             When other                                                 06480000
