               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R115ICA0-Fin-Inst-ID     08150000
                                                                        08160000
             When R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-Id Not = +0                      08170000
               Move R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-ID                             08180000
                                         To    R115ICA0-Fin-Inst-ID     08190000
                                                                        08200000
             When R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-No                               08210008
                                         Not = Space                    08220008
               Move  R115ICA0-In-Fin-Inst-No                            08230000
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-No            08240000
               Perform N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID                           08250000
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R115ICA0-Fin-Inst-ID     08260000
                                                                        08270000
             When other                                                 08280000
