      *################################################################.09650000
       J100-Move-DCL-To-Output           Section.                       09660000
      *                                                                 09670000
      * PLEASE REMEMBER:                                                09680023
      *    When you modify the code in this section, you need to do     09690023
      *    the same modifications in module F115ACA0 - E500-section.    09700023
      *                                                                 09710023
           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    R115ICA0-Fin-Inst-ID     09720000
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-Type      To    R115ICA0-Contract-Type   09730000
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-No        To    R115ICA0-Contract-No     09740000
