           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    W-Fin-Inst-ID            09760000
           Perform N200-Fetch-Fin-Inst-No                               09770000
           Move  W-Fin-Inst-No           To    R115ICA0-Fin-Inst-No     09780000
      *                                                                 09790000
           Move  TFCA-Currency           To    R115ICA0-Currency        09800000
           Move  TFCA-Orig-Amount        To    R115ICA0-Original-Amount 09810006
           Move  TFCA-Remain-Amount      To    R115ICA0-Remaining-Amount09820006
           Move  TFCA-Min-Pct-Toler      To  R115ICA0-Min-Pct-Tolerance 09830005
           Move  TFCA-Max-Pct-Toler      To  R115ICA0-Max-Pct-Tolerance 09840005
           Move  TFCA-Prev-O-Amount      To  R115ICA0-Prev-O-Amount     09850030
           Move  TFCA-Curr-O-Amount      To  R115ICA0-Curr-O-Amount     09860030
      *                                                                 09870000
           Compute  R115ICA0-Max-Amount                                 09880005
               =    TFCA-Remain-Amount                                  09890006
               +  ( TFCA-Remain-Amount * TFCA-Max-Pct-Toler / 100 )     09900006
      *                                                                 09910005
      * Info about the cursor:                                          09920000
      *                                                                 09930000
           Move  WC-Row-No               To  R115ICA0-Out-Row-No        09940000
           Move  WC-Total-No-Of-Rows     To  R115ICA0-Out-Total-Rows    09950000
      *                                                                 09960000
           .                                                            09970000
      *################################################################.09980000
       L100-Store-DCL                    Section.                       09990000
      *                                                                 10000000
      * We might already have this row in storage.                      10010017
      *                                                                 10020017
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        10030017
      *                                                                 10040017
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         10050017
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 10060017
             Then                                                       10070017
      *        If we have reached the end of the storage-table,         10080017
      *        we start on the beginning.                               10090017
      *        This way, we always keep the "newest" occurrences.       10100017
               Add   +1                  To    Ind-WS-Put               10110017
               If  Ind-WS-Put            >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         10120017
                   Move  +1              To    Ind-WS-Put               10130017
               End-If                                                   10140017
               Move  Ind-WS-Put          To    Ind-WS                   10150017
             Else                                                       10160017
               Move  Ind-WS              To    Ind-WS-Put               10170017
           End-If                                                       10180017
      *                                                                 10190017
      * We store the identification.                                    10200000
      *                                                                 10210000
           Move  R115ICA0-In-Table-Version                              10220026
                                         To    WS-DB2-Tbl-Version       10230026
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)10240000
           Move  FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID      To    WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID       10250026
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)10260026
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-Type      To    WS-DB2-Contract-Type     10270000
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)10280000
           Move  FK-TFMC-Contr-No        To    WS-DB2-Contract-No       10290000
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)10300000
           Move  TFCA-Currency           To    WS-DB2-Currency          10310000
                                                            (Ind-WS-Put)10320000
      *                                                                 10330000
      * The DCL is stored if found, the status is set.                  10340000
      *                                                                 10350000
           Evaluate True                                                10360000
             When Length                 Of    DCLTF-Contract-Amount    10370000
                > Length                 Of    WS-DB2-DCL               10380000
               Move  Length              Of    DCLTF-Contract-Amount    10390000
                                         To    WD-Length                10400000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    10410005
               Move  'GL-WL-DCL-UTVIDES' To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  10420005
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)10430005
               Move  WD-Length           To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)10440005
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               10450000
               Move  'L101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       10460005
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       10470000
      *                                                                 10480000
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 10490005
               Set   WS-DB2-Not-Found (Ind-WS-Put)                      10500000
                                         To    True                     10510000
      *                                                                 10520000
             When other                                                 10530000
               Move  DCLTF-Contract-Amount                              10540000
                                         To    WS-DB2-DCL   (Ind-WS-Put)10550000
               Set   WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS-Put)                           10560000
                                         To    True                     10570000
      *                                                                 10580000
           End-Evaluate                                                 10590000
      *                                                                 10600000
           .                                                            10610000
      *################################################################.10620000
       L200-Find-DCL                     Section.                       10630000
      *                                                                 10640000
           Perform Varying Ind-WS                                       10650000
                   From  +1              By    +1                       10660000
                   Until Ind-WS          >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         10670000
                   or  ( WS-DB2-Tbl-Version (Ind-WS)                    10680026
                                         =     R115ICA0-In-Table-Version10690026
                     and WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID (Ind-WS)                    10700026
                                         =     FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       10710026
                     and WS-DB2-Contract-Type (Ind-WS)                  10720000
                                         =     FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       10730000
                     and WS-DB2-Contract-No (Ind-WS)                    10740000
                                         =     FK-TFMC-Contr-No         10750000
                     and WS-DB2-Currency (Ind-WS)                       10760000
                                         =     TFCA-Currency )          10770018
           End-Perform                                                  10780000
      *                                                                 10790000
           .                                                            10800000
      *################################################################*10810000
       L300-Remove-DCL                   Section.                       10820000
      *                                                                 10830000
           Perform Varying Ind-WS                                       10840000
                   From  +1              By    +1                       10850000
                   Until Ind-WS          >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         10860000
                   or  ( WS-DB2-Tbl-Version (Ind-WS)                    10870026
                                         =     R115ICA0-In-Table-Version10880026
                     and WS-DB2-Fin-Inst-ID (Ind-WS)                    10890026
                                         =     FK-OAKO-FinInst-ID       10900000
                     and WS-DB2-Contract-Type (Ind-WS)                  10910000
                                         =     FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       10920000
                     and WS-DB2-Contract-No (Ind-WS)                    10930000
                                         =     FK-TFMC-Contr-No         10940000
                     and WS-DB2-Currency (Ind-WS)                       10950000
                                         =     TFCA-Currency )          10960018
           End-Perform                                                  10970000
      *                                                                 10980000
           Evaluate True                                                10990000
             When Ind-WS                 >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         11000000
               Continue                                                 11010000
      *                                                                 11020000
             When other                                                 11030000
               Initialize                      WS-DB2-Row (Ind-WS)      11040000
      *                                                                 11050000
           End-Evaluate                                                 11060000
      *                                                                 11070000
           .                                                            11080000
      *################################################################*11090000
       N100-Fetch-Fin-Inst-ID            Section.                       11100000
      *                                                                 11110000
           Move  W-Fin-Inst-No (1:4)     To    W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         11120008
      *                                                                 11130008
           If  Not R5879010-Versjon                                     11140000
           or  R5879010-In-Konsernnr     Not = W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         11150008
      *                                                                 11160000
               Initialize                      R5879010-Konsern         11170000
               Set   R5879010-Versjon    To    True                     11180000
               Set   R5879010-In-Select  To    True                     11190000
               Move  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr    To    R5879010-In-Konsernnr    11200008
               Call  'F5879010'          Using R5879010-Konsern         11210000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      11220005
               End-Call                                                 11230000
               If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                               11240005
                   Move  'N101'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       11250005
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   11260000
               End-If                                                   11270000
      *                                                                 11280000
           End-If                                                       11290000
      *                                                                 11300000
           Move  R5879010-Ut-KO-Konsern-Id                              11310000
                                         To    W-Fin-Inst-ID            11320000
      *                                                                 11330000
           .                                                            11340000
      *################################################################*11350000
       N200-Fetch-Fin-Inst-No            Section.                       11360000
      *                                                                 11370000
           If  Not R5879010-Versjon                                     11380000
           or  R5879010-In-Konsern-ID    Not = W-Fin-Inst-ID            11390000
      *                                                                 11400000
               Initialize                      R5879010-Konsern         11410000
               Set   R5879010-Versjon    To    True                     11420000
               Set   R5879010-In-Select  To    True                     11430000
               Move  W-Fin-Inst-ID       To    R5879010-In-Konsern-ID   11440000
               Call  'F5879010'          Using R5879010-Konsern         11450000
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      11460005
               End-Call                                                 11470000
               If  Not R7919999-Return-OK                               11480005
                   Move  'N201'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       11490005
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   11500000
               End-If                                                   11510000
      *                                                                 11520000
           End-If                                                       11530000
      *                                                                 11540000
           Move  R5879010-Ut-KO-Konsernnummer                           11550000
                                         To    W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr         11560008
           Move  W-Tmp-Konsern-Nr        To    W-Fin-Inst-No            11570008
      *                                                                 11580000
           .                                                            11590000
      *################################################################*11600000
       ZI00-Conv-Input-Version           Section.                       11610015
      *                                                                 11620000
      * Version control.                                                11630000
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         11640000
      *                                                                 11650000
           Set   R115ICA0-Version        To    True                     11660000
           Move  Length                  Of    R115ICA0-Contract-Amount 11670000
                                         To    W-IO-Length              11680000
      *                                                                 11690000
           Evaluate True                                                11700000
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115ICA0-Version-No      11710000
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            11720000
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              11730000
               Move  L-Ext-IO-Area (1:W-IO-Length)                      11740000
                                         To    W-Int-IO-Area            11750000
      *                                                                 11760000
             When Other                                                 11770000
               Call  'F115I999'                                         11780000
                   Using By Content      'F115ICA0 '                    11790000
                                         'INPUT '                       11800000
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  11810000
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  11820000
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            11830005
               End-Call                                                 11840000
      *                                                                 11850000
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                11860005
                   Move  'ZI03'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       11870005
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   11880000
               End-If                                                   11890000
      *                                                                 11900000
           End-Evaluate                                                 11910000
      *                                                                 11920000
           .                                                            11930000
      *################################################################*11940000
       ZO00-Conv-Output-Version          Section.                       11950015
      *                                                                 11960000
      * Version control.                                                11970000
      * If conversion is needed, we call the conversion module.         11980000
      *                                                                 11990000
           Evaluate True                                                12000000
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:8)    =     R115ICA0-Version-No      12010000
             and  Length                 Of    L-Ext-IO-Area            12020000
                                         Not < W-IO-Length              12030000
               Move  W-Int-IO-Area       To    L-Ext-IO-Area            12040000
                                                         (1:W-IO-Length)12050000
      *                                                                 12060000
             When Other                                                 12070000
               Call  'F115I999'                                         12080000
                   Using By Content      'F115ICA0 '                    12090000
                                         'OUTPUT '                      12100000
                         By Reference    L-Ext-IO-Area                  12110000
                                         W-Int-IO-Area                  12120000
                                         R7919999-Error-Area            12130005
               End-Call                                                 12140000
      *                                                                 12150000
               If  R7919999-Return-Abend                                12160005
                   Move  'ZO01'          To    R7919999-Paragraph       12170005
                   Perform Z900-Abend                                   12180000
               End-If                                                   12190000
      *                                                                 12200000
           End-Evaluate                                                 12210000
      *                                                                 12220000
           .                                                            12230000
      *################################################################*12240000
       Z000-Error-Message                Section.                       12250000
      *                                                                 12260000
           Set   R7918030-Version        To    True                     12270005
      *                                                                 12280000
           Move  'TF'                    To    R7918030-In-System-ID    12290005
           Move  R115X000-Fin-Inst-No    To    R7918030-In-Fin-Inst-No  12300007
           Move  R115X000-FI-Language-639-1                             12310007
                                         To    R7918030-In-Language     12320007
           If  R115X000-Trace-On                                        12330009
               Set   R7918030-In-Log-Yes To    True                     12340009
           End-If                                                       12350009
      *                                                                 12360000
           Call  'F7918030'              Using R7918030-ErrorMessage    12370005
           End-Call                                                     12380000
      *                                                                 12390000
           Move  R7918030-Out-MessageText                               12400005
                                         To    R7919999-Message         12410005
      *                                                                 12420000
           .                                                            12430000
      *################################################################*12440000
       Z900-Abend                        Section.                       12450000
      *                                                                 12460000
           If  R7919999-Return-Code      Not   Numeric                  12470005
           or  Not R7919999-Return-Abend                                12480005
               Move  +0                  To    R7919999-Module-Ind      12490005
           End-If                                                       12500000
      *                                                                 12510000
           Add   +1                      To    R7919999-Module-Ind      12520005
      *                                                                 12530000
           If  R7919999-Module-Ind       Not >                          12540005
                             ( Length    Of    R7919999-Module-Tab      12550005
                             / Length    Of    R7919999-Module-Element )12560005
               Move  'F115ICA0'          To    R7919999-Module-Name     12570005
                                                   (R7919999-Module-Ind)12580005
               Move  R7919999-Paragraph  To    R7919999-Module-Para     12590005
                                                   (R7919999-Module-Ind)12600005
           End-If                                                       12610000
      *                                                                 12620000
           Set   R7919999-Return-Abend   To    TRUE                     12630005
      *                                                                 12640000
           Goback.                                                      12650000
